=no` during compilation currently fails, this fixes that. Ping @BastiaanOlij @raulsntos \r\n\r\nTodo:\r\n\r\n- [x] test on mobile vr (used the godot demo project on desktop with vrs=xr and mobile renderer)\r\n- [x] test on openxr\r\n- [x] error checking for cases where camera count is not what expected\r\n\r\nThe results of calling the functions in gdscript on this branch and master gave the same output, at least to the 6 decimal places `print` gives us:\r\n\r\n    print(xr_camera_3d.project_local_ray_normal(Vector2.ZERO))\r\n    print(xr_camera_3d.project_position(Vector2.ZERO, 1.0))\r\n    print(xr_camera_3d.unproject_position(Vector3.FORWARD))\r\n    print(xr_camera_3d.get_frustum())\r\n\r\nAn image diff between the screenshot output of a mobile vr demo project also shows no changes, and I made sure to check in the debugger that `MobileVRInterface::get_vrs_texture()` was actually getting called in that scenario.","labels":[{"id":73330064,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWw3MzMzMDA2NA==","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/bug","name":"bug","description":"","color":"ff6055","default":true,"archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":865585000,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWw4NjU1ODUwMDA=","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/topic:xr","name":"topic:xr","description":"","color":"ffee88","default":false,"archived_at":null,"archived_by":null}],"milestone":{"id":15520464,"node_id":"MI_kwDOAO6SJc4A7NLQ","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/milestones/25","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/milestone/25","labels_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/milestones/25/labels","number":25,"state":"open","title":"4.8","description":"","creator":{"login":"Repiteo","id":17489292,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE3NDg5Mjky","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/17489292?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo","html_url":"https://github.com/Repiteo","followers_url":"https://api.gi